@startuml activity-manage-users
' Manage users (Administration module). Edit and Delete are on each row
' of the user list. Changes and deletions are also made in Clerk.
' A deleted user cannot be restored.

title Manage users

|Admin|
|Coffee Shop System|
|Clerk|

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Users;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the users\n(Edit and Delete on each row);
|Admin|
switch (What next?)
case ([done])
  stop
case ([edit])
  :2 · Click Edit on a user;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Show the edit form\n(with the user's details);
  repeat
    |Admin|
    :3 · Change details, role or status, then Save;
    |Coffee Shop System|
    :Check the changes;
  backward :Show the errors;
  repeat while (Valid?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
  |Clerk|
  :Update the account in Clerk;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Save the user;
case ([delete])
  |Admin|
  :4 · Click Delete on a user, then confirm;
  |Clerk|
  :Delete the account in Clerk;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Mark the user deleted;
endswitch
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the updated list;
stop

@enduml
